# Route: guide 18 of 53 of the simulator's completionist route for NightElf
# (1445 of 1459 eligible quests, 164.6 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 39 to
# 40, 6 quests, 0.4 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Loch Modan): Ironband's Excavation Site -> Stonesplinter Valley ->
# Ironband's Excavation Site -> Stonesplinter Valley -> Ironband's Excavation
# Site -> Thelsamar -> Stonesplinter Valley -> Thelsamar.
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): Amulet of Secrets (722; Magregan
# Deepshadow 38).
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category).

